      "description": "Every query is scoped to the authenticated organization.\n\nTime semantics: buckets are always UTC and the range is half-open, from\ninclusive to to exclusive. Omitting both defaults to the last 30 days.\n\nfilter is repeatable: ?filter=plan:pro&filter=country:SE means contains BOTH.",
